"may also name a class. Prefix with + to override only when the DSCP field is "
"zero."
msgstr ""
"Códphointí DSCP: CS0–CS7, AF11–AF43, EF, VA, NQB, LE, DF. Féadfaidh aon "
"luach dscp_* ainm a thabhairt d'aicme freisin. Cuir réimír + leis chun é a "
"shárú ach amháin nuair atá an réimse DSCP nialasach."

